            <ArticleTitle>Heel pain and body weight.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>254-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Body weight has been implicated as a factor in plantar heel pain. In this study, a statistically significant correlation between heel pain and increased body weight is documented in a series of consecutive plantar heel pain patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
